# The I/L's fourth job node, and the branch's single-target nuke: an orb that
# rides one enemy and shocks it thirty times over ten seconds, 871% eight lines
# a shock at master, with a current arcing off each shock for 513% four more.
#
# GMS's wording is the worst in the book and none of it survives reading
# literally. "Stunned #attackCount times" is eight LINES of one shock, not
# eight shocks; the current is not periodic and not a burn -- it fires once per
# shock, four lines at once. What the client actually holds: 30 shocks
# (`x`) on a 330ms beat (`subTime`, the field that spaced Bolt Barrage), each
# 391+16x over `mobCount 1`, and a separate invisible skill for the current at
# 243+9x, `attackCount 4`, `mobCount 2`.
#
# The orb hops between enemies while they still stand, which nothing here has a
# position to do -- so it pounds the front of the queue and moves on when that
# one falls. On a boss, which is what the skill is for, the two are the same.
#
# The stun is the third status this game keeps on a monster. Nothing here has a
# schedule to be knocked off, so what it buys is that the enemy is AFFLICTED --
# which Storm Magic has always been asking about, and which is 21% of final
# damage on every I/L swing at master -- and that other lightning then takes
# 12% more, which GMS states and excludes this skill from by name.
#
# The four seconds are CHOSEN. GMS states no stun duration anywhere in the
# common block, and a missing number there is the client hardcoding one. The
# shocks refresh it every 330ms, so what the number really decides is how long
# the rest of the book collects the 12% after the barrage ends.
#
# Dropped: the 3.4s of cooldown refunded for every shock that never fired. The
# orb spends all thirty in every fight this game holds -- it rides the front of
# the queue and the queue is never empty under it -- so the refund is zero
# wherever it would be read.
name: "Jupiter Thunder"
description:
  "Launch orbs full of the thunder god's power directly at your enemies. "
  "The orb goes inside the enemy it touched to deal continuous shock damage. "
  "An electric current flows around that enemy to attack others."
kind: SKILL_KIND_ATTACK
tags: SKILL_TAG_LIGHTNING
placement { job_advancement: JOB_ADVANCEMENT_ICE_LIGHTNING_ARCH_MAGE_V skill_order: 4 }
v_node: V_NODE_KIND_JOB
max_level: 30
required_equip_type: EQUIP_TYPE_STAFF
base_delay_ms: 810
cooldown_seconds: 120.0
max_enemies: 1
lines: 8
freeze_lines_per_spend: 5
stun {
  duration_seconds: 4.0
  final_dmg_pct: 0.12
  lifted_tag: SKILL_TAG_LIGHTNING
}
casts: 30
cast_interval_ms: 330
base { skill_pct: 4.07 }
